# Copy to .env (never commit the real one) for local work, or set the same names in the
# Cloudflare Pages / Workers project settings (Settings > Variables and Secrets, "Build" scope).
# Names starting with VITE_ are baked into the public site when it is built, so only ever put
# public addresses here, never keys or passwords.

# Address of the live Channel Green server (the Socket.IO realtime server, hosted separately, e.g. on Azure).
# Leave empty and /channel-green says honestly that the live town is not connected yet.
# Example shape: https://channel-green-realtime.example.com
VITE_REALTIME_URL=
